## Engineering standards

This project follows the cross-project engineering standards from `pulsarules_codex` (rules,
patterns, workflows), summarized as the skill list below. When this project also installs a
tool-specific layout (`pulsarules_cli install --target claude` renders `.claude/skills/`,
`--target opencode` renders `.opencode/skills/`), each skill's full instructions live there as
`<id>/SKILL.md`. When a rule or pattern is ambiguous, fall back to the Effective Go / Code Review
Comments baseline.

